{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0092_1000_022ser", "source_sha256": "49481fab5e7a3cd7bc36e1ec2124f9dff5a799497944dcfe97ff43d3c8879475", "ja": "{$P$}さん、聞いてください！\n昨日の夜、ふわふわで幸せな夢を見たんです！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，听我说！\n昨天晚上，我做了软绵绵又幸福的梦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0092_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c2e8e9e53cc09e3454c7d1e3547e6f41526699498cb267e63b16777782ab20c4", "ja": "ふわふわで幸せな夢……？\nどんな夢だったんだ？", "zh": "软绵绵又幸福的梦……？\n那是怎样的梦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0092_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "a8717114c84f5cba726d0a7390fa58ae24e54ecf43a81427b0e8049d04b5f056", "ja": "はい！　わたしが羊さんになって、\nジュニオールと一緒に、牧場で遊ぶんです♪", "zh": "嗯！我梦到自己变成绵羊，\n跟朱尼奥尔一起在牧场玩♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0092_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "ae1a7d022b409824f69ca70ff22d1f5decfe4d01835a9efb48e12d7c4f7fd141", "ja": "この前、お仕事で羊の衣装を着たから、\nそんな夢を見たのかもしれません。", "zh": "可能是因为之前工作穿了绵羊的服装，\n所以才做了这个梦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0092_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "4d2d700cda078dee1da886a9db125a0d1a676e056d5debd9da9fb531287910dc", "ja": "お仕事のあとは{$P$}さんが来て、\nわたしの毛を刈るって言ってました！", "zh": "工作结束以后，{$P$}先生出现，\n说要剃我的毛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0092_1005_p", "source_sha256": "35f456f12c9e9b5426dca6d7e87a737b2888b6e96180762717b2dc534f309e30", "ja": "毛を刈る……？", "zh": "剃毛……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0092_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "a1356796354ea6ad7105a173e5c0c5c6749e082455fa15c76e9f8cbc3588be8d", "ja": "はい！　羊は春になると、毛を刈って\n着替えるんだって教えてもらいました！", "zh": "是的！你在梦里说，每到春天，\n就要帮绵羊剃毛，让牠们换上新衣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0092_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "718c21b389a00904f61b2ab97a91974a30ca96dd507678c25b7900810bafe452", "ja": "なのにわたし、{$P$}さんが\n準備している途中で、目が覚めちゃったんです。", "zh": "但是{$P$}先生还在做准备的时候，\n我就醒来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0092_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "c6ef5850f437340b670460ddee910d927bbac90e9dda13f0fb5bc5973722abf7", "ja": "せっかく{$P$}さんが、\nバリカンを持ってきてくれたのに……。", "zh": "明明{$P$}先生都大费周章，\n特地拿了电推剪过来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0092_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2c9fcc865ccded4d65789978406ec33e8cb4eaf8915de1651a25484b0b71ff2c", "ja": "……夢の話！　あくまで、\n夢の中の話だよな、星梨花！", "zh": "……那是梦！再怎么说，\n那都只是梦对吧，星梨花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0092_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "69c4262566372533ecf99f8b1289b573cc7d952022db48d12562f2ec959205cd", "ja": "はい、そうですよ？　あっ、そろそろ\nお仕事の時間ですね。今日も1日、頑張りましょう！", "zh": "嗯，是梦没错呀。\n啊，差不多该去工作了。今天一整天也要加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
